# =============================================================================
# Frontend (SvelteKit) — copy to .env for local development
# Production: Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Variables and Secrets (Production / Preview)
# PUBLIC_* values are embedded in the built JavaScript and readable by anyone.
# =============================================================================
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://api.isobath.jocarium.productions

# =============================================================================
# GitHub repository (kokimiza/isobath) — NOT read from this file.
# Set in GitHub → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions.
# Used by .github/workflows/nightly.yml (nightly batch, 01:00 JST cutoff).
# =============================================================================
#
# [Secret] NIGHTLY_DATABASE_URL  (required)
#   Supabase Transaction pooler (port 6543) as the isobath_batch role.
#   Runners have no IPv6, so never use the direct db.<ref>.supabase.co host.
#   postgresql://isobath_batch.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
#
# [Variable] CHART_K  (optional, default 10)
#   Density cells with fewer people than this are hidden in the public chart (FR-CHT-04, Q-06).
#   CHART_K=10
#
# --- API deploy (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job deploy-api; runs after lint + tests pass on main) ---
# Put these in the "production" Environment (Settings → Environments) or at repository level.
#
# [Secret] RENDER_API_KEY  (required)
#   Render → Account Settings → API Keys. Grants access to the whole Render account: keep secret.
#
# [Variable] RENDER_SERVICE_ID  (required; an identifier, not a secret)
#   RENDER_SERVICE_ID=srv-daosaa142hec73807270   # isobath-api
#
# Render side: turn Auto-Deploy OFF for isobath-api, or every push deploys twice
# (once untested by Render itself, once by this workflow).
#
# Do NOT store in GitHub: Supabase secret / service_role keys, isobath_api password (Render only).
